# Credentials for yasp-agent's `yasp-toolkit`, which the kernelgen and kernelgen evaluation
# steps run. yasp-toolkit reads this variable from the environment, so export it before
# running the check (for example `set -a; . ./.env; set +a`); nothing reads this file for you.
# Create a key at https://compile.yasp.ai/dashboard/tokens, or store one in the OS keyring
# instead with `yasp-toolkit keyring set` and leave the variable unset.
# Only yasp-toolkit reads this key, and the steps that run your model.py (the model check and
# `kernelgen export`) start without it; the check mints no key for the Gaia worker, which you deploy
# yourself (see README.md, "Deploy the Gaia worker").
# Installing yasp-agent reads the yasp package index with a registry key minted from this key
# (`yasp-toolkit registry key`), handed to pip as a temporary netrc file (see README.md).
YASP_API_KEY=
